目糖果（限时）"},"Item/3/11":{"name":"苦目糖罐（限时）"},"Item/3/20":{"link":"苦目糖果"},"Item/3/21":{"link":"苦目糖罐"},"Item/1/481004":{"icon":"481002"},"Episode/1660301":{"episode":{"name_En":"Dripping Inside the Hourglass"}},"Episode/1660302":{"episode":{"name_En":"A Flood of Memories"}},"Episode/1660303":{"episode":{"name_En":"Want Something"}},"Episode/1660304":{"episode":{"name_En":"Part Ways"}},"Episode/1660305":{"episode":{"name_En":"Heart of Flesh"}},"Episode/1660306":{"episode":{"name_En":"The Limited Sky in the Teapot"}},"Episode/1660307":{"episode":{"name_En":"No More Astray"}},"Episode/1660308":{"episode":{"name_En":"After the Endless Plain"}},"Episode/1660101":{"episode":{"name_En":"The Third and the Ninth"}},"Episode/1660102":{"episode":{"name_En":"What the Xiangruis Do"}},"Episode/1660103":{"episode":{"name_En":"Idle Time"}},"Episode/1660104":{"episode":{"name_En":"A Place to Belong"}},"Episode/1660105":{"episode":{"name_En":"A Place to Belong"}},"Episode/1660106":{"episode":{"name_En":"Festoons"}},"Episode/1660107":{"episode":{"name_En":"Difficult Is the Way"}},"Episode/1660108":{"episode":{"name_En":"Till the Last Drop"}},"Room_building/22003":{"numLimit":3},"Room_building/22103":{"numLimit":3},"Episode/712":{"episode":{"afterStory":100718}},"Episode/10721":{"episode":{"afterStory":100732}},"ChapterElement/复兴！乌卢鲁运动会":{"chapter_map_fragment":{"5002":{"content":"<b>独家揭秘：复兴小队携兔女郎大闹市政厅，公务员遭恐吓致精神崩溃</b><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;乌卢鲁运动会即将被复兴，神秘学家的竞技之火将重燃。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我们中的许多人都听说过这个消息，或许是你，或许是我，某些幸运儿也与那女学生所带领的“复兴小队”擦肩而过，人们对他们充满好奇——这是当然的，一团火，一个九年级学生，一个人类菌菇学家，再加上一个拥有圣洛夫基金会背书的大人物，这足够令人感到心中瘙痒，难以压抑。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;如同近日街头巷尾频繁出没的本耶普，那些乌黑潮湿的下流玩意儿从下水道中爬出来，来到光天化日之下，成为了瞩目的焦点。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>“兔女郎的身后跟着一位疯狂科学家，巨型大啡菇和像素鸸鹋在火焰旁大跳曳步舞。”</b><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;你会在哪里看到这样的画面？科幻电影、马戏团，还是梦里？不不不，这一切都发生在爱丽丝泉市政厅，如此魔幻而荒诞，这也正是凯特女士对复兴小队的第一印象。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>“我……我们承接过不少大型活动与典礼，都……都是些有礼节、讲规矩的客人。可他……他们太过分了，他们……天呐……我的教养不允许我复述他们的行径，请您谅解。”</b><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;如前文所言，复兴小队带来的混乱彻底摧毁了凯特女士的一天。谈及这段遭遇时，她多次凝噎，甚至于语无伦次地啜泣。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;让我们重新思考那个看起来漂亮辉煌的盛会，思考祖辈口中所描述的“乌卢鲁运动会”。我们真的需要它吗？还是某些人告诉你，你真的需要它，好来唤醒你心中对“运动”与“公平”的热爱？他们的目的是什么？售票？或是一场彻底的造星？<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;去看看你今早刚撕去的那页日历吧——时代的指针已经走到世纪末的十年，是谁要将那些腐朽、死去的传统再挖掘出来？四处贩卖的入场券换来的金钱又入了谁的口袋？<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;——<b>是啦，我们早已有了答案！</b><br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;撰稿人：马科尔<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;——《叮咚快报》136期周末特刊<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>&nbsp;<b>《叮咚快报》——每个人都能拥有的“私家侦探”！</b></i>"}}},"Summon_pool":{"25191":{"nameCn":"镜中无对影","type":3,"nameEn":"The Mirror's Lonely Watcher","upWeight":"3088|3060#3061"}},"Char/3088":{"summon_character":[{"id":25191,"heroId":3088,"skinId":0,"location":1}]},"Char/3149":{"activeSkill_set_1":"1#31490111|2#31490121","activeSkill_set_2":"1#31490131|2#31490141"},"Effect/31470131":{"isBigSkill":0},"Episode/1306":{"episode":{"story":101310}},"Char/3017":{"skin":{"3":{"_seriesName":"绿茵的盛典","_seriesNameEn":"CARNIVAL ON THE PITCH"}}},"Char/3032":{"skin":{"3":{"_seriesName":"绿茵的盛典","_seriesNameEn":"CARNIVAL ON THE PITCH"}}},"Char/3025":{"skin":{"3":{"_seriesName":"绿茵的盛典","_seriesNameEn":"CARNIVAL ON THE PITCH"}}},"Char/3028":{"skin":{"3":{"_seriesName":"绿茵的盛典","_seriesNameEn":"CARNIVAL ON THE PITCH"}}},"Char/3022":{"skin":{"3":{"_seriesName":"红土地","_seriesNameEn":"ON THE RED LAND"}}},"Char/3053":{"skin":{"3":{"_seriesName":"红土地","_seriesNameEn":"ON THE RED LAND"}}},"Char/3015":{"skin":{"3":{"_seriesName":"红土地","_seriesNameEn":"ON THE RED LAND"}}},"Char/3050":{"skin":{"2":{"_seriesName":"红土地","_seriesNameEn":"ON THE RED LAND"}}},"Char/3070":{"skin":{"3":{"_seriesName":"红土地","_seriesNameEn":"ON THE RED LAND"}}}}